# el2 -- Lenovo Yoga Slim 7x (X1E80100) booting at EL2, for KVM.
#
# Committed in patches/el2/, not fetched: 0003-0029 are Stephan Gerhold's
# wip/qcom-laptops-6.17-el2 series, whose codelinaro branch is dead (mirror:
# github.com/jglathe/linux_ms_dev_kit), and 0001, 0002, 0030 and the 'local:'
# patches were written locally. There is no manifest upstream to take.
#
# Order is the series order and it matters -- these are git format-patch
# commits with Fixes: edges between them. Provenance: docs/PATCHES.md.

0001-arm_scmi-perf-audit-firmware-perf-limits.patch
0002-ASoC-qcom-x1e80100-lift-speaker-volume-caps.patch
