# Copied byte-for-byte from armada (kernel/patches/<name> at ARMADA_REF
# eb63d011a3a9) so el2 keeps USE_ARMADA=no and an armada rebase cannot break
# this build. Generic fixes, not SoC-gated: 0204 stops tsens lower-threshold
# irqs aborting s2idle, 0517 fixes typec mux/switch EPROBE_DEFER swallowing
# (silently missing DP-alt). Details in docs.local/PATCHES.md.
0204-thermal-qcom-tsens-mask-lower-threshold-irqs-across-suspend.patch
0517-usb-typec-mux-dont-swallow-EPROBE_DEFER.patch
